"┏ Reply┌Keys──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐━━━━━━┓"
"┃To:   │Tab / Shift-Tab          Next field / previous field                      │      ┃"
"┃Cc:   │Enter  ↑ ↓               Move between From, To, Cc and Subject            │      ┃"
"┃Subjec│← →  in From             Change the account it is sent from               │      ┃"
"┃──────│Ctrl-O                   Hide or show the original message                │──────┃"
"┃1     │in the original          v V pick and y copy, Esc back to the body        │      ┃"
"┃      │a, b; c                  Separate several addresses                       │      ┃"
"┃      │i a I A o O              Type in the body, insert mode                    │      ┃"
"┃      │Esc                      Back to normal mode                              │      ┃"
"┃      │h j k l w b e 0 $ gg G   Move in the body                                 │      ┃"
"┃┌  Rep│dd cw x p u Ctrl-R v V   Edit vim style                                   │─────┐┃"
"┃│1   F│Ctrl-A                   Attach a file (Tab to it, d takes it off)        │     │┃"
"┃│  1 S│Ctrl-S                   Send                                             │     │┃"
"┃└─────│Esc in normal mode       Close, asking first if anything was written      │─────┘┃"
"┗━━━━━━│Ctrl-C                   Quit                                             │━━━━━━┛"
" NORMAL└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘       "
